  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "dfilter: Improve error handling / autocompletion for layers",
  "description": "Add a distinct error message when a layer operator (#) is immediately\nfollowed by the end of a filter. This transforms the error from a\npremature end of filter into a generic one, and prevents\nDisplayFilterEdit from offering field autocompletion after layers,\nsimilar to what is already done with the '[' that begins a slice.\n\nPing #12811\n\nBefore:\n$ ./run/dftest 'ip.addr#'\nFilter:\n ip.addr#\n\nError: Unexpected end of filter expression\n\nAfter:\n$ ./run/dftest 'ip.addr#'\nFilter:\n ip.addr#\n\nError: The layer number or range was missing.\n  ip.addr#\n          ^",
